# NOTE: Assets/ and Assets/StreamingAssets/ (including generated .glb models)
# are intentionally tracked so the experience ships complete.

# Local album audio you supply yourself stays OUT of the repo (it's copyrighted).
# Drop 01.ogg..12.ogg in Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/ for local playback only.
Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/*.ogg
Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/*.mp3
Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/*.wav
Assets/StreamingAssets/Audio/*.m4a
